  "description": "<p>Do you want to study in a premier institution and excel in business and management?</p><p>Are you looking to start your career in entrepreneurship or business?</p><p>Paris School of Business (PSB) is one of the top business schools in France. With a faculty of industry professionals and practitioners, PSB offers a practical approach to business education.</p><p>For over 60 years, PSB has been a centre of academic excellence. Renowned for its innovative programs, PSB continues to educate and empower students in business and entrepreneurship.</p><p>Paris School of Business offers various programs, including undergraduate degrees in international management and specialised master's programs in finance, management, marketing analytics, entrepreneurship, business development, and luxury management.</p><p>Want to know more? Discover why the Paris School of Business might be the place for you!</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p>  <p>Paris School of Business was founded in 1965. The institution offers a wide range of programs, including undergraduate, master's, and doctoral degrees, as well as executive education and professional development courses.</p><p>PSB welcomes a significant number of international students every year, offering a global and multicultural learning environment.</p> <p>PSB's campus provides modern facilities to students to support their academics. These include lecture halls, seminar rooms, and computer labs equipped with the latest technology.</p><p>Additionally, PSB offers dedicated spaces for collaboration and networking for students. This includes facilities such as a cafeteria, the Creative Lab, and the PSB Library.</p> <p><strong>Why Paris School of Business?</strong></p> <ul><li>PSB offers undergraduate, and master's programs, doctoral degrees, and executive education courses to students across the globe.</li><li>The institutionâ€™s faculty comprises over 100 experienced professors, researchers, and industry experts from around the world.</li><li>PSBâ€™s campus provides a dynamic and fun-filled environment for students, with high-tech facilities and infrastructure.</li></ul><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p><p>PSB provides a dynamic learning environment for students aspiring to become business leaders and entrepreneurs. Students can engage in many clubs and events, along with attending guest lectures and industry events.</p><p>PSBâ€™s International programs have their Student Union, offering activities and sports facilities to students.</p><p>Paris School of Business enjoys proximity to many multinational companies and financial institutions. The campus is surrounded by multiple dining and entertainment spots, providing students with a fulfilling and rich experience.</p>",
